@host = http://localhost:5172

### Get orders for Acme tenant
GET {{host}}/orders
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### Get orders for Globex tenant
GET {{host}}/orders
X-Tenant-Id: globex

### Get current tenant info for Acme
GET {{host}}/me
X-Tenant-Id: acme

### Get current tenant info for Globex, from the query string resolver
GET {{host}}/me?tenant=globex

### A custom access validator refuses this request with 403
GET {{host}}/orders
X-Tenant-Id: globex
X-Block-Access: true

### /me allows a missing tenant, so the same refused request runs without one (the endpoint's own 404)
GET {{host}}/me
X-Tenant-Id: globex
X-Block-Access: true

### Get current tenant info for Globex
GET {{host}}/me
X-Tenant-Id: globex

### Get current tenant info without tenant header (the endpoint's own 404: it allows a missing tenant)
GET {{host}}/me

### Health check (no tenant required)
GET {{host}}/health
